Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:02.801
-Stick around.
Come on back.

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:05.133
-♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.267
♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:09.534
♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:11.567
♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:13.801
♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.901
♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:15.968 --> 00:00:18.234
♪ Snowball, snowball,
snowball fight! ♪

00:00:18.234 --> 00:00:21.200
-Yeah. That's the real deal.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.501
That's my jam.
That's my jam right there.

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.868
Oh, my God.
An original.

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:28.901
Wow. Original there.

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:29.968
"Snowball Fight."

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.067
Not bad.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.534
-We just learned it right now.

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.868
-Okay, okay. Good, good.
-That's the way The Roots play.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.000
We did that once --

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.334
Springsteen was the best example
of that.

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:44.100
We had Springsteen
and Little Steven here.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.767
And they were talking
and Bruce goes --

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:47.634
I had an old set list of his,
and he's like,

00:00:47.634 --> 00:00:50.434
[ As Springsteen ]
"There's a song there --

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.767
Roots, Roots, you ever heard --

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.634
You know the song
'Wiggle Waggle,' right?

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:55.501
You know the song
'Wiggle Waggle'?"

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:56.801
[ Normal voice ]
And Roots are like, "No.

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:58.133
We don't know the song
'Wiggle Waggle.'"

00:00:58.133 --> 00:00:59.801
[ As Springsteen ] "Anyway,
it's the greatest song.

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:01.868
You'd love it.
Anyway, we played this song,

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:03.501
then we'd get
into 'Candy's Room.'"

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:04.834
[ Normal voice ]
Whatever. We talked.

00:01:04.834 --> 00:01:06.267
And then I go, "Well, alright,
we'll be right back

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.801
with more of Bruce Springsteen
and Little Steven."

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.901
And The Roots played
"Wiggle Waggle."

00:01:09.901 --> 00:01:13.634
And Bruce's face looked like
a kid on Christmas morning.

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.367
[ As Springsteen ] It was like,
"That's 'Wiggle Waggle'!"

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:16.701
That's 'Wiggle Waggle'!"

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.133
[ Mumbles ]

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.300
[ Normal voice ] I couldn't even
understand what he was saying.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.734
[ As Springsteen ]
That's 'Wiggle Waggle'!"

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:23.467
[ Playing "Wiggle Waggle" ]

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:29.467
♪♪

